      "id": "claim_a54a50db913549f09dac8072688f6271",
      "statement": "executeGoal decomposes a created goal via ResourceScheduler.canSchedule (a defer emits a goal_deferred convergence event) and GoalDecomposer.decomposeGoalToDAG, then starts the loop via startObjectiveLoop (with repository_path from the goal's registered extra repo or LOOP_DAEMON_REPOSITORY_PATH; a repo named by the proposal that is not registered aborts with REPO_NOT_REGISTERED) for objective mode or startDocDriftAndSmallFixLoop otherwise — a resumed run reopens getLoopRun(resume_run_id) — and creates one prepared maker lease via continueLoopRun with max_assignments 1 / max_maker_workers 1; LOOP_DAEMON_MAKER_RUNTIME is the operator's explicit maker-runtime choice for objective mode and the bandit's fallback.",
