      "statement": "With LOOP_BANDIT_ENABLED (and never on a resumed evolve sibling) the daemon can rewrite the maker lease runtime via chooseSpecies — Thompson sampling over skill_outcomes keyed loop-maker:<loopName>:<runtime>, first LOOP_BANDIT_SPECIES entry incumbent, challengers below PROMOTE_AFTER (20) outcomes capped to LOOP_BANDIT_MAX_SHARE (default 10 %); zeros that are not the species' fault (infra_failed, no_change, evolve:lost_eligible) are excluded from the stats (RX-3). With the bandit on it also chooses over LOOP_DAEMON_MAKER_RUNTIME, which stays the fallback (Y1); the choice is recorded on the lease metadata and as a bandit_selected event carrying posterior and max_share (RX-15), an unavailable runtime degrades to bandit_skipped.",
