      "id": "claim_9927e2742ba94b6982c16a7e3ffc6ba1",
      "statement": "Under LOOP_EVOLVE_ENABLED for test-gap/mutation-gap goals (or metadata.evolve === true), the daemon runs up to two sibling makers from LOOP_EVOLVE_SPECIES via retryLoopRun(sibling) — never the species the bandit already chose as the first maker — then selectEvolveWinner ranks all contenders in code: hard gates (exit 0, checks pass, diff in budget and the goal's artifact changed), then mutation score, then diff lines, then tokens (a GRADED_CONTEST_MODE=act override can take the highest SI-A graded score instead). The winner stays the only non-superseded maker; losers are superseded, their reviewer leases cancelled, every leftover prepared maker superseded, and each finished loser's loss recorded as a skill_outcomes row (N7 lineage); with no eligible maker the run fails like a single-maker run (evolve_no_winner).",
