      "statement": "Maker execution timeouts/diff caps are lane-dependent: the mutation lane (detected via mutationCheckEnv's MUTATE_FILE/MUTATE_TEST) gets 600 s and 400 diff lines, the dead-code/finding-fix/advisory lanes size their own caps (2 000 / FINDING_FIX_DIFF_MAX / ADVISORY_DIFF_MAX), other lanes LOOP_MAKER_TIMEOUT_MS (default 300 s, cap 600 s) and 200 lines; deterministic checks are scoped by LOOP_DAEMON_CHECK_SCRIPTS (an extra repo's by EXTRA_REPO_CHECKS_<SLUG>) with LOOP_DAEMON_CHECK_TIMEOUT_MS (default 120 s, cap 600 s), and a blocked result retries the maker once via retryLoopRun, the retry inheriting a pending approval only under inheritableApproval's strict rule (D4).",
