      "id": "claim_3a24bb1e847e43bcbccc582902711498",
      "statement": "The deploy runs the operator-installed host copy of deploy-vps.sh (/usr/local/lib/djimitflo/deploy-vps.installed.sh, installed by scripts/install-deploy-script.sh <sha> --apply with a sha256 install record), never the commit's copy: the installed copy is trusted only when it and every directory above are root-owned and not group/other-writable, is read once into a private temp dir and hashed against its record, and the commit's scripts/deploy-vps.sh (fetched from raw.githubusercontent at that SHA) is fetched only to compare — a mismatch pauses auto-deploy; deploy-vps.sh --local then prunes old builds keeping a week of build cache and requires >= 6 GB free disk, fetches the exact commit into a fresh root-only dir and verifies FETCH_HEAD (the build input is never the container's writable runtime-source clone), builds djimitflo:main-<short> pinned to the base image digest and writes/verifies a write-once build receipt, chown 1001 the runtime-source checkout (objective-mode worktrees), backs up and rewrites compose.yml (image, DJIMITFLO_COMMIT_SHA, runtime-source mount), force-recreates the container, polls health for 60 s and on unhealthy — or a healthy container whose image is not the receipt's — restores the compose backup and recreates the previous container (rollback, exit 1).",
